      "AudioContext constructor schedules lazyInitialize in a later task.",
      "lazyInitialize invokes startRendering when not already Running.",
      "startRendering checks stopped/user-suspended initially, but the pinned async successful destination completion sets Running without rechecking Closed.",
      "Explicit resume and implicit lazy auto-start have separate destination callbacks.",
      "close sets Closed and uninitializes after destination.close completes.",
      "BaseAudioContext.setState does not treat Closed as terminal.",
      "First worklet registration invokes workletIsReady then destination.restartRendering; restart does not itself set context state.",
      "Playwright bootstrap patch does not modify the three inspected Web Audio implementation files."
    ],
    "inference": "A pending implicit auto-start completion can overwrite Closed even after explicit resume promise completed. This is a plausible engine race, not an execution-proven attribution.",
    "designComparison": {
      "deferResume": "Can lose transient user activation and does not itself remove constructor implicit startup.",
      "awaitModuleInClose": "May indefinitely delay close if asset/module operation never settles.",
      "ownedStateChangeCleanup": "Preserves immediate resume and prompt first close; can re-close only owned contexts if engine later reports non-closed. Should avoid polling, shared contexts, and capturing the entire synth. Requires real late-state evidence and regression tests."
    },
